storical music trends in 2020, but found researching tedious and uninspiring, losing sight of what initially drew them to the subject. They also lost interest in a music-related project halfway through, feeling it took away the joy of music. However, they later launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music, which allowed them to reach a wider audience, share experiences authentically, and receive positive feedback. This invigorated their passion for music and helped them connect with others.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s3\", \"s4\", \"s5\", \"s6\", \"s7\", \"s15\", \"s16\", \"s17\", \"s27\", \"s28\", \"s34\", \"s35\", \"s36\", \"s37\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"past\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user's own statements across multiple conversations document a history of starting and pausing a music trends podcast in 2018 due to time demands and loss of passion, trying a historical music trends podcast in 2020 that felt tedious, losing interest in a music project that diminished joy, and later successfully launching a fusion music podcast that reignited their passion and received positive feedback.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7366, "total_tokens": 7787, "completion_tokens": 421, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-8771baa024e86d4b", "protocol": "plain"}, "response_ref": "e66eb9f38f725a7d06a13da21df759b43306907286d9e038e73ef9462c2d2035", "output_tokens_estimate": 634, "finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7366, "total_tokens": 7787, "completion_tokens": 421, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_