c music, which they find authentic and fulfilling.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s3\", \"s4\", \"s5\", \"s6\", \"s7\", \"s15\", \"s16\", \"s17\", \"s18\", \"s19\", \"s27\", \"s28\", \"s34\", \"s35\", \"s36\", \"s37\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"current\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user explicitly states they stopped podcasting about music trends (s3-s6) and found music theory tedious (s15-s16, s27-s28). They now prefer live performances, genre exploration, playlists, and personal reflection (s18-s19). They also launched a new podcast on traditional/electronic fusion (s34-s37), which they find invigorating.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7365, "total_tokens": 7703, "completion_tokens": 338, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-a396569d882f8619", "protocol": "plain"}, "response_ref": "702f6151ff37b960e9395aeb6af4b18593105684f0980801574fb51fce03ad51", "output_tokens_estimate": 454, "finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7365, "total_tokens": 7703, "completion_tokens": 338, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-a396569d882f8619", "protocol": "plain", "sequence": 260, "elapsed_seconds": 122.28020405769348}
